Module 15 – Disaster Recovery (Velero)
Objective

Implement Kubernetes Disaster Recovery (DR) using Velero to:

Backup Kubernetes resources
Store backups inside LocalStack (S3)
Restore deleted applications
Simulate namespace deletion
Verify successful recovery

This gives our Cloud Native Platform a production-like Disaster Recovery mechanism.

